GsMonkArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Zen Thunder: standing within your own Lightning Aura enters zen
	Every fourth melee or summon strike in zen unleashes a piercing thunder-palm wave
	'''
GsMonkShinobiArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Zen Thunder, Shinobi: zen palms trigger every third strike
	Each wave splits into two side palms on its first hit
	'''
GsSquireArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Oath Bulwark: taking a hit raises the oath shield for 5 seconds
	Melee strikes during it hurl a gilded oath lance from your shoulder
	'''
GsSquireValhallaArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Oath Bulwark, Valhalla: the shield holds for 6 seconds
	Every melee strike during it hurls twin oath lances
	'''
GsHuntressArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Snare the Prey: enemies caught in your explosive traps are marked
	Ranged hits on marked prey call two thorn bolts from the flanks
	'''
GsHuntressRedRidingArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Snare the Prey, Red Riding: explosive traps mark enemies
	Ranged hits call three venom-tipped thorn bolts from the flanks
	'''
GsApprenticeArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Kindlecraft: your Flameburst tower's hits build kindling
	At 6 stacks the next magic hit unfolds a fire glyph over the target, raining three ember bolts
	'''
GsApprenticeDarkArtistArmor.EndowLine:
	'''
	Kindlecraft, Dark Artist: 5 stacks of kindling trigger the glyph
	The glyph turns to shadowflame, raining four shadow embers that ignite foes
	'''
